<title>UK: Seton buys SmithKline Beecham brand.</title>
<headline>Seton buys SmithKline Beecham brand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seton Healthcare Group Plc said on Monday it has purchased the OTC cystitis brand, Cymalon, from drugs giant SmithKline Beecham Plc for 3.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Seton also announced that it has purchased the Far East rights of the Woodward's gripe water and teething gel businesses from London International Group Plc for 3.5 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
